flowchart TD
  Receive["Validate message and load state"] --> Extract["Extract, validate and merge changes"]
  Extract --> Missing{"Important ambiguity or missing detail?"}
  Missing -->|Yes| Ask["Ask a focused question"]
  Missing -->|No| Search["Search and apply hard constraints"]
  Search --> Matches{"Eligible records?"}
  Matches -->|Yes| Rank["Rank and explain up to two"]
  Matches -->|No| NoMatch["Explain no match; propose adjustment"]
  Ask --> Save["Save turn and valid state"]
  Rank --> Save
  NoMatch --> Save
  Save --> Next["Wait for next customer message"]
